   171	The last factor is a polynomial with constant term 1, so polynomiality forces
   172	`l'' := (v'−u−1) − u·l ≥ 0`. (The earlier reading "`l'' = 0` gives a Keller grandchild" is FALSE:
   173	the last factor is non-constant for `l ≥ 1`; only the exponent condition survives. Moh's own
   174	category is not closed under descent, as `depth-residual` already recorded.) Licence at `u = 1`:
