+a physical t-disc is a new nonzero eta-support exponent. The two series and the
+two notions of exponent must be connected by a theorem. Congruence alone does not
+complete that connection or permit modification of a frozen complete characteristic
+prefix. Thus B is **CONFIRMED-WITH-FIX**, not a license for the proposed free-W search.
