+**7. The ell shift and the promotion decision.**
+
+Xu Lemma 4.1 is valid for arbitrary polynomial `J`, and its right side is
+`-J(t^{-1},alpha)t^{-2}` (X:193–202). For `J=c x^ell`, this becomes
